<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia tugrik falls 0.3 pct vs dollar in week.</title>
<headline>Mongolia tugrik falls 0.3 pct vs dollar in week.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia's tugrik fell 0.3267 percent against the dollar on Monday compared with the previous Monday, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The Bank of Mongolia's official rate for the tugrik was down to 801.40 against the U.S. currency on Monday from 798.79 the previous Monday.</p>
<p>The central bank calculates the official rate based on the previous week's interbank trade.</p>
<p>- Ulan Bator newsroom (976-1-312565)</p>
